#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:11
msgid "Prepare an Asset for Newton with MJWarp"
msgstr "为 Newton MJWarp 准备资产"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:15
msgid ""
"This page is the source of truth for the ``isaaclab-preparing-assets-for-"
"newton`` agent skill (`skill source <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/blob/develop/skills/user/prepare-assets-for-"
"newton/SKILL.md>`__). When you change this page, update the skill so agent "
"guidance stays in sync. See :doc:`/source/developer-tools/agent_skills`."
msgstr ""
"本页是 ``isaaclab-preparing-assets-for-newton`` 智能体技能的权威参考（ `技能源文件 "
"<https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/blob/develop/skills/user/prepare-"
"assets-for-newton/SKILL.md>`__ ）。修改本页时，也应更新该技能，使智能体指导保持一致。参见 "
":doc:`/source/developer-tools/agent_skills` 。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:22
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:24
msgid ""
"Understand how Isaac Lab selects a backend and its task-specific preset "
"before changing an asset; see :ref:`backends-and-presets`. This guide "
"prepares an asset and task for ``physics=newton_mjwarp``. After both "
"backends run the asset and task, use :doc:`/source/how-"
"to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton` to transfer a policy "
"checkpoint. For the conceptual differences that require target-solver "
"validation, see :ref:`solver-differences`; use :doc:`/source/how-"
"to/solver_tuning_mjwarp` for the focused MJWarp tuning procedure."
msgstr ""
"修改资产前，先了解 Isaac Lab 如何选择后端及任务特有预设；见 :ref:`backends-and-presets` 。本指南为 "
"``physics=newton_mjwarp`` 准备资产和任务。两种后端都能运行资产与任务后，再通过 :doc:`/source/how-"
"to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton` 迁移策略检查点。需要在目标求解器中验证的概念差异见 "
":ref:`solver-differences` ；专门的 MJWarp 调参流程见 :doc:`/source/how-"
"to/solver_tuning_mjwarp` 。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:33
msgid "Import a multi-physics asset"
msgstr "导入多物理后端资产"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:35
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab assets can work with both ``physics=physx`` and "
"``physics=newton_mjwarp``. Many assets author USD Physics and PhysX schemas;"
" Newton parses the supported authored properties into its model, so a "
"separate Newton-only copy is not required. Confirm each property against the"
" supported feature and schema documentation: an authored PhysX attribute can"
" be present without MJWarp using it during stepping."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 资产可以同时用于 ``physics=physx`` 和 ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` 。许多资产编写了 "
"USD Physics 和 PhysX 模式，Newton 会将受支持的属性解析到自身模型中，因此不需要单独制作 Newton "
"专用副本。请根据功能和模式文档核对每项属性：资产中存在某个 PhysX 属性，并不代表 MJWarp 在步进时会使用它。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:41
msgid ""
"For a new URDF or MJCF asset, use the Isaac Lab importers to create a multi-"
"physics asset. Keep ``run_asset_transformer`` and "
"``run_multi_physics_conversion`` enabled (both default to ``True``) so the "
"conversion creates neutral physics, PhysX, and MuJoCo payloads. The current "
"converter uses a nested rigid-body structure rather than the earlier flat "
"USD structure. See :doc:`/source/how-to/import_new_asset`, "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg`, and "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg`."
msgstr ""
"对于新的 URDF 或 MJCF 资产，使用 Isaac Lab 导入器创建多物理后端资产。保持 ``run_asset_transformer`` 和"
" ``run_multi_physics_conversion`` 启用（两者默认均为 ``True`` ），使转换生成中立物理、PhysX 和 "
"MuJoCo payload。当前转换器采用嵌套刚体结构，而非早期的扁平 USD 结构。参见 :doc:`/source/how-"
"to/import_new_asset` 、 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg` 和 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg` 。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:49
msgid "Separate common and solver-specific properties"
msgstr "区分通用与求解器特有属性"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:51
msgid ""
"Put common USD Physics properties in solver-common configuration classes "
"such as ``RigidBodyBaseCfg`` and ``JointDriveBaseCfg``. Put backend-only "
"properties in the matching subclasses:"
msgstr ""
"将通用 USD Physics 属性放入 ``RigidBodyBaseCfg`` 、 ``JointDriveBaseCfg`` "
"等求解器通用配置类，将后端专属属性放入对应子类："

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:55
msgid ""
"Use ``MujocoRigidBodyPropertiesCfg``, ``MujocoJointDrivePropertiesCfg``, and"
" ``MujocoCollisionCfg`` for MJWarp-specific properties."
msgstr ""
"MJWarp 特有属性使用 ``MujocoRigidBodyPropertiesCfg`` 、 "
"``MujocoJointDrivePropertiesCfg`` 和 ``MujocoCollisionCfg`` 。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:57
msgid ""
"Use the matching ``Newton*PropertiesCfg`` classes for supported Newton-"
"native collision, material, articulation, and related properties."
msgstr "受支持的 Newton 原生碰撞、材质、关节体等属性，使用对应的 ``Newton*PropertiesCfg`` 类。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:59
msgid ""
"Keep PhysX-only damping, stabilization, solver-iteration, friction-patch, "
"and compliant-contact properties in the matching ``Physx*PropertiesCfg`` "
"classes."
msgstr "PhysX 专属的阻尼、稳定化、求解器迭代、接触面摩擦和柔顺接触属性，保留在对应的 ``Physx*PropertiesCfg`` 类中。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:62
msgid ""
"For configuration hierarchy and parameter-to-USD routing, see "
":doc:`/source/concepts/schema_cfgs`. Check the :doc:`Newton/MuJoCo schema "
"API </source/api/lab_newton/isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas>` and :doc:`PhysX "
"schema API </source/api/lab_physx/isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas>` for supported"
" fields. A value present in a PhysX asset or imported Newton model is not "
"proof that MJWarp consumes it."
msgstr ""
"配置继承体系和参数到 USD 的对应规则见 :doc:`/source/concepts/schema_cfgs` 。受支持字段请查看 "
":doc:`Newton/MuJoCo 模式 API "
"</source/api/lab_newton/isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas>` 和 :doc:`PhysX 模式 API "
"</source/api/lab_physx/isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas>` 。某个值存在于 PhysX 资产或导入的 "
"Newton 模型中，并不能证明 MJWarp 会使用它。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:69
msgid "Audit the mechanical model"
msgstr "检查机械模型"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:71
msgid "Inspect every dynamic link and contact-relevant object:"
msgstr "检查每个动态连杆及与接触相关的物体："

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:73
msgid ""
"Author positive mass [kg], center of mass [m], and positive-definite inertia"
" [kg*m^2]. Treat a placeholder inertia warning as a modeling failure, and "
"verify the inertia and center-of-mass frames."
msgstr "设置正质量 [kg]、质心 [m] 和正定惯量 [kg*m^2]。出现占位惯量警告时，应视为模型问题，并核对惯量与质心的参考坐标系。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:76
msgid ""
"Apply ``UsdPhysics.CollisionAPI`` only to intentional collision geometry. "
"Check approximation, mesh scale, contact offset or margin, material binding,"
" restitution, and self-collision filters; visual parity is not collision "
"parity."
msgstr ""
"只为有意参与碰撞的几何体应用 ``UsdPhysics.CollisionAPI`` "
"。检查近似方式、网格缩放、接触偏移或裕量、材质绑定、恢复系数和自碰撞过滤；外观一致并不意味着碰撞一致。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:79
msgid ""
"Verify the articulation root, fixed-base representation, fixed-joint "
"merging, nested rigid bodies, joint types, axes, and limits."
msgstr "验证关节体根节点、固定基座表示、固定关节合并、嵌套刚体、关节类型、轴和限制。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:81
msgid ""
"Make each body-level gravity setting intentional. A stale override can make "
"a task differ from scene gravity."
msgstr "确保每个刚体级重力设置都有明确用途。过时的覆盖值可能使任务中的重力与场景重力不同。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:85
msgid "Match collision, contact, and friction behavior"
msgstr "匹配碰撞、接触和摩擦行为"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:87
msgid ""
"Do not copy PhysX friction settings numerically. First verify intended "
"collision shapes, material bindings, contact locations, contact count, and "
"available gripper normal force in both backends. Then inspect the resolved "
"per-shape MuJoCo contact dimensionality, ``condim``: ``1`` is frictionless, "
"``3`` adds tangential friction, ``4`` adds torsional friction, and ``6`` "
"also adds rolling friction. Choose the smallest model that represents the "
"contact physics and confirm that the importer and contact path preserve it."
msgstr ""
"不要直接照搬 PhysX 摩擦参数的数值。先在两个后端验证预期碰撞形状、材质绑定、接触位置、接触数量和夹爪可用法向力。然后检查各形状解析后的 "
"MuJoCo 接触维数 ``condim`` ： ``1`` 为无摩擦， ``3`` 增加切向摩擦， ``4`` 增加扭转摩擦， ``6`` "
"还增加滚动摩擦。选择能表达接触物理的最小模型，并确认导入器和接触路径保留了该设置。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:94
msgid ""
"Tune material friction against measured tangential slip only after the "
"contact model is valid. ``MujocoCollisionCfg`` also exposes expert per-"
"collider overrides such as ``priority``, ``solmix``, ``solref``, and "
"``solimp``; use them only with a measured contact-model need. Use "
":attr:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas.NewtonCollisionCfg.contact_margin`, "
":attr:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas.NewtonCollisionCfg.contact_gap`, and "
":attr:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas.NewtonMeshCollisionCfg.max_hull_vertices`"
" instead of raw importer attributes. Follow :ref:`mjwarp-solver-tuning` for "
"the current global solver and contact tuning sequence."
msgstr ""
"接触模型有效后，再根据实测切向滑移调整材质摩擦。 ``MujocoCollisionCfg`` 还提供 ``priority`` 、 "
"``solmix`` 、 ``solref`` 和 ``solimp`` 等逐碰撞体高级覆盖选项，仅在测量证明接触模型需要时使用。请使用 "
":attr:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas.NewtonCollisionCfg.contact_margin` 、 "
":attr:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas.NewtonCollisionCfg.contact_gap` 和 "
":attr:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas.NewtonMeshCollisionCfg.max_hull_vertices`"
" ，不要使用导入器的原始属性。当前全局求解器与接触调参顺序见 :ref:`mjwarp-solver-tuning` 。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:106
msgid "Validate actuators and limits"
msgstr "验证执行器和限制"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:108
msgid ""
"Audit per-joint effort limits, stiffness, damping, friction, armature, "
"action scale, and control period. Armature applies only to articulated "
"coordinates: use a physically justified reflected motor/transmission inertia"
" or a controlled response test, and do not use it to hide bad body mass, "
"inertia, units, reset penetration, or contact capacity. Retune damping after"
" changing armature. For the general actuator model and configuration "
"guidance, see :ref:`overview-actuators`."
msgstr ""
"检查各关节的驱动力上限、刚度、阻尼、摩擦、电枢惯量、动作缩放和控制周期。电枢惯量只作用于关节坐标，应使用有物理依据的折算电机/传动惯量，或通过受控响应试验确定；不要用它掩盖错误的刚体质量、惯量、单位、重置穿透或接触容量。改变电枢惯量后应重新调整阻尼。通用执行器模型和配置指南见"
" :ref:`overview-actuators` 。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:114
msgid ""
"``actuator_velocity_limit`` is the actuator's physical rated speed. Isaac "
"Lab can use it in actuator or task logic, observations, rewards, and "
"terminations, but MJWarp does not parse it into the solver model or enforce "
"it while stepping. ``joint_velocity_limit`` requests a solver-side hard "
"clamp. Isaac Lab writes it to Newton's ``Model.joint_velocity_limit``; "
"MJWarp drops that field, while Kamino honors it. When a task needs a speed "
"bound under MJWarp, implement and validate it in task or control logic. Use "
"``joint_effort_limit`` for the simulated effort limit and "
"``actuator_effort_limit`` to clip an explicit actuator model, choosing both "
"from the motor and gearbox rather than using one oversized value for the "
"whole robot."
msgstr ""
"``actuator_velocity_limit`` 是执行器的物理额定速度，Isaac Lab "
"可在执行器或任务逻辑、观测、奖励和终止条件中使用它，但 MJWarp 不会将其解析到求解器模型，也不会在步进时施加该限制。 "
"``joint_velocity_limit`` 请求求解器侧硬限幅，Isaac Lab 将其写入 Newton 的 "
"``Model.joint_velocity_limit`` ；MJWarp 丢弃该字段，而 Kamino 会执行它。如果 MJWarp "
"任务需要速度边界，应在任务或控制逻辑中实现并验证。仿真驱动力限制使用 ``joint_effort_limit`` ，显式执行器模型限幅使用 "
"``actuator_effort_limit`` ；两者都应根据电机和齿轮箱确定，不要为整个机器人设置同一个过大值。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:124
msgid "Run paired smoke tests"
msgstr "运行成对冒烟测试"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:126
msgid ""
"Run the same fixed task state through both backends before training or "
"transfer:"
msgstr "训练或迁移前，在两种后端中运行相同的固定任务状态："

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:133
msgid ""
"Let each run cross multiple resets. Record object displacement, contact "
"count, gripper effort, penetration, and success rate for the same fixed "
"grasp. Also check for non-finite state, first-step impulses, unexpected "
"saturation, excessive angular velocity, contact loss, and importer or solver"
" warnings. Reject robot-object and robot-support penetration, impossible "
"mimic states, and invalid randomized geometry before the first physics step."
msgstr ""
"让每次运行经历多次重置。对同一固定抓取，记录物体位移、接触数量、夹爪驱动力、穿透和成功率。还应检查非有限状态、首步冲量、异常饱和、过大角速度、接触丢失，以及导入器或求解器警告。第一个物理步之前就应排除机器人与物体/支撑面的穿透、不可满足的"
" mimic 状态和无效随机几何。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:140
msgid "Account for solver differences"
msgstr "考虑求解器差异"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:142
msgid ""
"After the paired smoke tests, use the target solver's controls to address "
"the differences described in :ref:`solver-differences`:"
msgstr "成对冒烟测试后，使用目标求解器的参数处理 :ref:`solver-differences` 所述差异："

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:145
msgid ""
"Revalidate contact behavior with the smallest useful environment count and a"
" visualizer before scaling up."
msgstr "扩大规模前，使用少量但足以验证的环境和可视化器，重新验证接触行为。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:147
msgid ""
"Retune material friction from measured slip; PhysX patch friction and MJWarp"
" contact friction are not numerically interchangeable."
msgstr "根据实测滑移重新调整材质摩擦；PhysX 接触面摩擦与 MJWarp 接触摩擦不能直接按数值互换。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:149
msgid ""
"Retune restitution from observed bounce and chatter rather than assuming a "
"PhysX scene threshold applies to Newton."
msgstr "根据观察到的反弹和抖动重新调整恢复系数，不要假定 PhysX 场景阈值也适用于 Newton。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:151
msgid ""
"Compare timestep and ``num_substeps`` against the fixed reproduction, "
"especially for contact-heavy tasks."
msgstr "使用固定复现案例对比时间步长和 ``num_substeps`` ，尤其是接触密集任务。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:153
msgid ""
"When a PhysX task used CCD, validate a Newton collision strategy and shorter"
" solver timestep as needed; MJWarp's ``ccd_iterations`` is not a CCD switch."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 任务使用 CCD 时，应验证 Newton 的碰撞策略，并按需缩短求解器时间步长；MJWarp 的 ``ccd_iterations`` "
"不是 CCD 开关。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:155
msgid ""
"For Kamino, validate reset-state consistency and only then investigate "
"constraint stabilization or convergence settings."
msgstr "对于 Kamino，先验证重置状态一致性，再研究约束稳定化或收敛设置。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:159
msgid "Diagnose Newton-only failures"
msgstr "诊断仅在 Newton 中发生的故障"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:161
msgid ""
"Reproduce the first failing step with one environment, a fixed seed and "
"reset state, no domain randomization, and the same action sequence in both "
"backends. Localize the failure before tuning:"
msgstr "使用一个环境、固定种子和重置状态，关闭域随机化，并在两个后端使用相同动作序列，复现首次失败的步。调参前先定位故障："

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:164
msgid ""
"At initialization or the first step, inspect mass, inertia, scale, reset "
"overlap, topology, drives, and unsupported features."
msgstr "初始化或第一步失败时，检查质量、惯量、缩放、重置重叠、拓扑、驱动和不受支持的功能。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:166
msgid ""
"At contact onset, inspect contact locations and counts, capacity warnings, "
"margins, ``condim``, friction, cone choice, and extreme mass or inertia "
"ratios."
msgstr "开始接触时失败，检查接触位置和数量、容量警告、裕量、 ``condim`` 、摩擦、摩擦锥选择，以及极端质量或惯量比。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:168
msgid ""
"Under control, inspect effort and gain limits, action scale, ``dt``, "
"substeps, damping, armature, and joint-limit impacts."
msgstr "控制期间失败时，检查驱动力和增益限制、动作缩放、 ``dt`` 、子步、阻尼、电枢惯量及关节限位冲击。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:170
msgid ""
"In dense scenes, compare the busiest environment with per-environment "
"contact and constraint capacities."
msgstr "密集场景中，对比负载最重环境与逐环境接触/约束容量。"

#: source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton.rst:173
msgid ""
"Enable ``NewtonCfg.debug_mode`` to inspect iteration-cap usage. Increase "
"overflowing capacity first; change convergence settings only after the "
"asset, reset, controller, contact model, and capacities are valid. Keep the "
"smallest fixed-state reproduction and record the first non-finite quantity "
"so later changes can be compared one at a time."
msgstr ""
"启用 ``NewtonCfg.debug_mode`` "
"，查看迭代上限使用情况。先增大溢出的容量；只有资产、重置、控制器、接触模型和容量均有效后，才改变收敛设置。保留最小固定状态复现案例，记录第一个非有限量，便于逐项对比后续修改。"
